# Node / TypeScript preset for gh skim.

# Lock files. Machine-resolved, thousands of lines, and the thing a reviewer
# actually cares about is the manifest change that caused them.
**/package-lock.json
**/yarn.lock
**/pnpm-lock.yaml
**/bun.lockb
**/bun.lock

# Build output. Should not be committed, frequently is.
**/dist/**
**/build/**
**/.next/**
**/coverage/**

# Generated clients and types, e.g. GraphQL codegen and OpenAPI generators.
**/__generated__/**
**/*.generated.ts
**/*.generated.js

# Jest and Vitest snapshot baselines.
**/__snapshots__/**
